# OpenSpec Workflow

- Treat `docs/requirements.md` as the stable PRD and OpenSpec as executable capability detail.
- Use stable IDs from `docs/requirements.md`; do not invent new ID families without updating the PRD.
- Write scenarios with `#### Scenario:` headings and GIVEN/WHEN/THEN bullets.
- Run `npx -y @fission-ai/openspec validate --all --strict` after spec changes.
- Do not archive or mark a slice complete until gates and checker review are green.
